  "title": "The New Siri in iOS 27: Apple's Leaked AI Assistant, Search or Ask, and 'Siri 3.0'",
  "summary": "The new Siri is coming. Bloomberg's iOS 27 Siri leak shows a rebuilt AI assistant (some are calling it Siri 3.0) living in the Dynamic Island, a new Search or Ask interface, a dedicated chatbot-style Siri app, AI-powered web search, ChatGPT and Gemini choices, and deeper access to personal and on-screen context. Here is what the new Siri does, when it is coming, and how VoiceOS already brings the same voice-to-action experience to Mac and Windows today.",
